# Environment variables — names only, never values.
#
# IMPORTANT: this app currently uses NO custom secrets.
# Auth, database, file storage, function hosting, and integrations are all
# Base44 platform services; the app binding lives in base44/.app.jsonc,
# which is gitignored on purpose. Do NOT commit real .env files.
#
# If you later add server secrets, declare them by name here and configure
# the actual values in the Base44 dashboard (never in GitHub).
